Output docs/demos/cli.gif
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/.install-check/bin:$PATH"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "flunky --version"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "flunky add --help"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "flunky list --help"
Enter
Sleep 3s
